    "updated_at": "2021-08-04T07:08:20Z",
    "body": "I was kind of curious how it was more efficient and why people might want to use this. It would also be interesting to know if people today have this kind of data structure and end up having to convert it to suit the `Headers` constructor.\r\n\r\n(Also, to be clear, is the data model essentially `[headerName1, headerValue1, headerName2, headerValue2, ..., headerNameN, headerValueN]`?)",
